			"notes": "# Changes\n* Major overhaul to how the Beef Chunkus Item works.\n* Resourcepack texture updated.\n\n## The Major Overhaul\n* Beef Chunkus now has 70 \"notches\" of food, this translates to food points.\n* Right-Clicking Beef Chunkus will fill your hunger fully if enough notches are present. (Otherwise it fills up to the remaining notches)\n* Saturation given is equal to the amount filled multiplied by 1.4.\n* Added a notches tooltip"
